1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Gel magic! Go, Sticky Salamander! And gotcha!

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
We'll leave you for now. But remember this day, Magic Knights.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:50,000
We are the Eye of the Midnight Sun, and we will bring the Clover Kingdom to its knees!

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:01,000
You've kept me waiting.

8
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,000
No! It can't be!

9
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,000
The Wizard King, Julius Novokrono.

10
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Kill him now!

11
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,000
How did you...

12
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Yeah, sorry about that. It would have been far too difficult to restrain all of you.

13
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:22,000
So, let's make a deal. I'll let the first person to surrender survive.

14
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Well, do we have any takers?

15
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Not happening!

16
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,000
How is he moving like that? He's so fast I can't even see him!

17
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,000
A test then. We'll see if it will work on this many.

18
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Time-binding magic.

19
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Chronostasis!

20
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:48,000
What. Did. He. Do!

21
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Bodies. Frozen.

22
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
Can't. Move.

23
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Well, would you look at that. I got you all.

24
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Guess I overestimated your skills.

25
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Ow! Ow! Ow!

26
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Oh, Osta. There you are. It's nice to see you again. We keep running into each other.

27
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Uh, yeah.

28
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Yeah. You want to be the Wizard King someday. Isn't that right?

29
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Then I suggest you carefully consider everything you've seen here.

30
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:20,000
This was only the smallest example of the sort of power you'll have to outmatch.

31
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Get ready. Something's coming.

32
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,000
So bright!

33
