Do you think we're moving a little fast here?

271
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:37,000
You care about formality all of a sudden?

272
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:47,000
The wizard king had concluded that the attack on the royal capital was the work of terrorists targeting the clover kingdom.

273
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:51,000
In a public speech he made clear his determination to continue to fight.

274
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:55,000
The people greeted this declaration with wholehearted support.

275
00:10:55,000 --> 00:11:03,000
The invasion was only possible because some of the mages in charge of maintaining the city's magic barrier had disappeared.

276
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:05,000
Were they eliminated?

277
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:07,000
Or did they go willingly?

278
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:13,000
After assessing the situation, the wizard king came to his own conclusion.

279
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:15,000
But it was not one he wished to make public.

280
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:21,000
As much as I don't want to believe it, there must be a traitor among the royal capital's mages.

281
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:27,000
It's no use. With protect magic cast on them, we can't get any information.

282
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:36,000
Hmm.

283
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:43,000
We are not keeping quiet because of some spell. The Master is a light in the darkness. He's more than a man. He is our kitty!

284
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,000
We are not keeping quiet because of some spell.

285
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:51,000
The Master is a light in the darkness. He is more than a man. He is our god!

286
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:53,000
We were abandoned style...

287
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:55,000
Dan, he is our God!

288
00:11:56,000 --> 00:12:00,000
We were abandoned, but he always stood by us.

289
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:05,000
You can do what you want, but we would sooner die than betray him.

290
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:16,000
Whatever the identity of this master, the loyalty he commands is undeniable, as is the breadth of his power.

291
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:21,000
He's most likely the one who brought down Fuegolion. I doubt his minions could have.

292
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:27,000
Indeed. We'll have to ask the captain. Perhaps he can tell us more about the attacker.

293
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:32,000
Let's bide our time until the King of Lions awakens.

294
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:40,000
Damn you! Damn you! Damn you! Damn you! Damn you!

295
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:44,000
I'm in pain, and it's all your fault! You did this to me!

296
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:50,000
You miserable, useless bread-hasta! I'm going to enjoy destroying you!

297
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:53,000
I'll assemble a wraith army and tear you limb from limb!

298
00:12:54,000 --> 00:13:00,000
Wait, are you talking about the anti-magic kid? Asta? No! You can't kill him!

299
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:05,000
I've got research to do, and I need him alive and wriggling if I'm going to get the best results!

300
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:10,000
What's more, I healed that scratch of yours, so there's no way you're feeling any pain now.

301
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:18,000
No! It's real! I still hurt! And as for that kid I saw him first, so you stay away! Hands off, you understand me?

302
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,000
I'm not listening! I'm not listening!

303
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:22,000
I'm not listening!

304
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,000
Ugh!

305
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:26,000
Asta and I are going to have so much fun together!

306
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,000
Ugh!

307
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:41,000
It's too bad I don't know when I'll get to see him again, but fortunately I was able to snag a good sample while he was in my gel!

308
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:45,000
Now for a little anti-magic research!

309
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:50,000
I was unable to save Georg or Catherine.

310
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:59,000
Those two may be willful, but they worship you. Their loyalty to the cause is absolute. I doubt they will reveal anything.

311
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:06,000
It's not information that I'm concerned about. As long as they are alive, I will rescue them.

312
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:20,000
I thought I had dodged it, but it seems that attack did graze me after all.

313
